Like a middleman.

30
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:30,680
Exactly.

31
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:33,800
You act as the single point of contact in Germany,

32
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,600
interfacing with the client.

33
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,800
And then in India, you find a counterpart,

34
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:41,840
