51
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:20,040
they apply the Foreign Tax Act.

52
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,960
Right, the Hinser-Reknoom's besturing.

53
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,880
Exactly, that one.

54
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,480
Meaning they just see right through the shell company.

55
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,520
Pretty much.

56
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:28,920
They look for the place of effective management.

57
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:29,240
Okay.

58
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,480
So if your IP address is in Germany

59
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:33,720
