84
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:28,360
Trade tax infection sounds nasty.

85
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,360
It is.

86
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,240
If you mix your personal consulting work

87
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:33,600
