92
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:45,240
You set up a separate German UG.

93
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,400
An entrepreneur gazelle.

94
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,600
Exactly, which is essentially a mini LLC.

95
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:52,120
And you use this UG strictly for the outsourcing business.

96
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:52,640
Oh, I see.

97
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:55,520
So the UG becomes the legal container for the agency

98
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:58,520
completely shielding your personal freelance status

99
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,600
